                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### The Logic Is Kept\n\nConsidering that we have two hands and two feet, we continue to use circles, bars, and lines to represent the next numbers. For example, to write the numbers from 11 to 15, we do this:",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
