         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this class, we learned the missing Mesoamerican numbers, from 10 to 19. We observed that there is only one logic for creating the numbers, and that it can be associated with our body.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
